WEBVTT

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:17.700
Plush-chan!

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:03.470
Step... by step...

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:09.960
I'm home...

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:11.230
Pop!

00:02:11.230 --> 00:02:13.620
Do you know what time it is?

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.650
Didn't you promise to come home at five?

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:21.740
But we went to play at Mika-chan's, everyone went home without cleaning.

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:22.660
So I...

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:24.800
No more excuses.

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:28.620
You'll have to take out the garbage for a week if you can't keep your promises.

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:31.760
How come only I have to come home at five?

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.090
Doremi always plays until very late.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:39.980
She's not playing. She's helping an old lady with her store.

00:02:39.980 --> 00:02:40.990
I'm home.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:43.040
Welcome back! You're home quite early.

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.780
I'm hungry. Is dinner ready?

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:48.110
It's almost done. Wash your hands first!

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:49.280
Okay.

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:50.430
Pop, you too!

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:55.980
I can't accept this!

00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.390
Majo Rika Goes to Kindergarten.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.920
We don't have many customers today.

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:16.880
Because it's such a beautiful Sunday.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.090
Everybody must've gone out to play.

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:22.500
I wish we'd get that luxury once in a while.

00:03:23.490 --> 00:03:25.900
What are you babbling about?

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:32.400
We need magic spheres to practice magic, so we have to make money.

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:34.910
That's true, but...

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.460
Just sometimes...

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:37.150
That's right.

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.630
I said not a chance!

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:42.320
Don't just mumble there, go get some customers!

00:03:42.900 --> 00:03:45.010
When a person is mean like that...

00:03:45.010 --> 00:03:47.040
Judgment day will come.

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.810
Welcome.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.750
Pop-chan!

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.380
Whatcha up to?

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.130
What is it?

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.270
Want anything?

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:58.980
I came here to check Doremi's work.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.400
You little...

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.430
What a beautiful pendant!

00:04:05.430 --> 00:04:08.890
But definitely not Doremi's work.

00:04:09.430 --> 00:04:11.570
I made that one.

00:04:11.570 --> 00:04:13.580
This item will cheer you up.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:15.060
As I expected, Hadzuki-chan.

00:04:15.860 --> 00:04:16.820
What's going on?

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:18.740
This is so interesting.

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.110
I made it.

00:04:20.110 --> 00:04:21.280
I knew it!

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:24.240
Ai-chan's work has different taste.

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:27.010
Don't be so cheeky!

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:27.840
Got it!

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:31.790
This is Doremi's!

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:34.870
Definitely!

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.710
Ya know her so well.

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.380
They're sisters after all.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.420
Of course I know.

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.800
The shape is raw.

00:04:42.800 --> 00:04:45.800
No one in their right mind would make something so tasteless.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:47.760
Except Doremi.

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:52.830
Dang it, Pop you little brat!

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.800
Stop!

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:57.370
Whee! Doremi is angry!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:58.790
Stop running!

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.030
Those idiots.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.530
Why are they fighting in my store?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.120
Stop!

00:05:09.230 --> 00:05:11.430
Stop, Pop!

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:14.290
Don't mess around in the store!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:23.340
Oh no.

00:05:25.350 --> 00:05:27.060
What's this?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.340
T-That's a...

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:31.510
Doll.

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:34.140
It-It-It-It...

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.840
It's so cute.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.480
Cute?

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.280
It feels so plushy.

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.510
Plushy?

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:43.650
I'm buying this!

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:45.940
Y-you're buying it?

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.040
Well...

00:05:47.040 --> 00:05:48.980
It's very expensive.

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:49.840
Right, right.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.660
You can't afford it with your allowance.

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.110
How much?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.250
I remember Pop has 200 yen a month for her allowance.

00:05:59.250 --> 00:06:00.300
Which means...

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.000
Alright!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.260
That doll is...

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:06.670
A thousand yen!

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:08.550
A thousand yen?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:12.490
How about that? I don't suppose you could afford it with your allowa...

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:13.480
I'll take it.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.980
Alright then!

00:06:18.900 --> 00:06:22.570
It was smart of me to save my money for a rainy day.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.480
See you!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.190
Work hard, Doremi.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.740
She's gone!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:36.080
I never expected Pop to save her allowance.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.330
We'll have to get Majo Rika back.

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:40.670
You're right.

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:42.790
Yeah, we can't leave her alone.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:44.590
I think it'll be alright.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.420
She's a Witch Frog.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:50.050
She can still use magic if she has her Crystal.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:52.760
If she doesn't like it, she can always come back.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.140
Is that so?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.770
It'll be alright if she can use magic.

00:06:56.770 --> 00:07:00.810
Since Majo Rika isn't here, lets take a rest for one day.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.730
Ya think?

00:07:01.730 --> 00:07:03.150
I agree.

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.900
Sometimes we just have to have fun.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.440
Is it okay?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.320
Yeah.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.900
Alright!

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:13.450
Hey hey, where should we go?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.620
Well, we could...

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:15.740
Okay then...

00:07:15.740 --> 00:07:18.160
I'm going to have some fun too.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.670
Good night.

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.440
I know!

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:45.440
Since we're friends from now on...

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:46.900
You're gonna need a name.

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:52.450
Ah, that's it.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.450
Since you're so plushy...

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:55.490
Plush-chan!

00:07:55.490 --> 00:07:57.660
What? What did you say?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.640
Nice to meet you, Plush-chan.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:02.330
Plush-chan.

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:04.790
Hey, Doremi, come and help me!

00:08:04.790 --> 00:08:08.340
I can't use magic without my Crystal!

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:11.800
Plush-chan, she said...

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:15.260
Not you too, Doremi!

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.770
I'll take you to kindergarten tomorrow.

00:08:19.770 --> 00:08:21.600
Good night, Plush-chan.

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:27.610
Just how long does she plan to stay?

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:31.610
Does she really like Pop so much?

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:41.330
I'll take my chance to go to Doremi's room.

00:08:47.540 --> 00:08:48.630
Plush-chan...

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:51.420
I-I-I-I can't breath...!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:57.600
Heh!?

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.600
Then, Majo Rika is still with Pop-chan.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.930
Yeah, at the kindergarten.

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.980
It seems she likes Pop-chan very much.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.770
What is she thinking?

00:09:06.770 --> 00:09:10.820
Well, maybe Majo Rika thinks it's fun.

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:30.460
Are you having fun, Plush-chan?

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.300
I'm exhausted.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:33.920
Pop-chan.

00:09:34.670 --> 00:09:36.300
What's that?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:38.430
This? Plush-chan!

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.180
She's my new friend.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.100
Plush-chan?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:44.100
You're right. It's all plushy!

00:09:45.060 --> 00:09:46.230
Plushy!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.400
It's my turn, it's my turn.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:49.730
Wait a bit.

00:09:50.770 --> 00:09:51.610
What?

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:55.190
It's so cute!

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.780
Let me touch it!

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:59.530
Stop, all of you!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:03.990
Majo Rika, why didn't you run away with your magic?

00:10:07.120 --> 00:10:08.330
People!

00:10:13.340 --> 00:10:14.590
Kimitaka!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.090
Show it to us too!

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.050
No way!

00:10:19.050 --> 00:10:22.600
If that's your attitude, I'm not gonna show it to you.

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.060
This is my chance!

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:28.060
You're always so cheeky!

00:10:28.060 --> 00:10:30.150
Get away from Pop-chan!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:35.650
When Pop-chan is in danger...

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.110
We'll be by her side no matter where she is!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:39.360
Misaki!

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.610
Fumio!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:41.870
Tatsuya!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.370
Kazuhiro!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:44.870
Yoshihiko!

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:50.080
We are Pop-chan's elite bodyguards!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.540
Are you stupid?

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.750
Are you referring to Pop-chan?

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:55.550
Gotta run! Gotta run!

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:55.590
Gotta run! Gotta run! Gotta run!

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:57.380
I meant you people!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:59.470
Gotta run! Gotta run! Gotta run!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:02.970
What are you doing!?

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.560
Don't come near me!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.230
I'm gonna beat you to a pulp!

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:09.730
Bring it on!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:13.360
Oh, forget it.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.150
Plush-chan!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.160
Let go of me! I don't know how to swim!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:31.670
Oh Lala! Thank God you're here!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:35.920
Do you really want to be Plush-chan? Why didn't you use magic?

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:39.130
Hell no! I don't have my Crystal!

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:41.430
I'm taking this!

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:25.390
Okay then, let's do this one on page 27 next.

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:28.760
Lala.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:30.350
What's she doin'?

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.600
What? What?

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:37.820
"The wind blows the bug."

00:12:37.820 --> 00:12:41.070
"Trouble, can't sing, uproar."

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:42.530
What's that?

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.530
You're both wrong.

00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:49.580
"The Witch Frog has no magic."

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:51.910
"It's a matter of life and death."

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:52.500
That's it.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.710
Hey, how did ya get that?

00:12:57.580 --> 00:13:00.670
But, what does it mean she has no magic?

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:02.880
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan?

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:07.930
Alright, I know it's difficult, but anyone manage to solve it?

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.200
What's the matter, Harukaze?

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:15.100
My stomach is...

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.020
Are you alright?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.110
Teacher!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.730
We'll take her to the nurse.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:25.070
Fine, go ahead.

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:27.820
Did you eat any weird food?

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.080
Perhaps the problem is too difficult?

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.700
Why you little...

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:32.870
Doremi-chan!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.170
Come on, let's go!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.960
She lost her Crystal?

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.130
So that's why she ain't usin' magic.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.720
But when?

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.800
Probably when she was taken out of the Maho-Dou.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.880
That must be it.

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.770
That's why she let Pop do anything to her.

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:57.230
Anyway, I'll go back to Maho-Dou to find the Crystal.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.610
All of you think of something for Majo Rika.

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:00.520
Okay.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.320
Please.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:04.440
But, what do we do?

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:07.530
Well, before that, I have to be in the nurse's office.

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.160
Heh?

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.120
I'll ask Dodo to cover for me.

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.250
Excuse us.

00:14:17.250 --> 00:14:17.830
Come in.

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:19.920
What's the matter?

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:21.380
Doremi-chan is...

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:25.880
L-Looks like a stomachache.

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:27.670
Please let her rest here for a while.

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:31.260
Well then, you can lie down here.

00:14:31.260 --> 00:14:32.600
Yes ma'am.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.830
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.040
Alright!

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:09.380
I said give it back!

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.010
Come and get it if you can.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.270
Kimitaka!

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.440
Give it baaaack!

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.650
No way!

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:23.440
Come on!

00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.190
Here!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:26.230
Give Plush-chan back to me!

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:29.650
Give it back!

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.610
No way!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:33.620
Stop it!

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:38.330
Pop-chan!

00:15:38.330 --> 00:15:42.000
That's what you get for not listening to me.

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:43.670
Meanie!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:45.840
I'm telling the teacher!

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:46.630
Wait.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.680
That won't be necessary.

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:56.220
I'm not going to lose to you!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:59.480
I'll get Plush-chan back no matter what!

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.060
Ow!

00:16:08.620 --> 00:16:10.020
Where's Majo Rika?

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.740
Huh, well then. Looks like I got here in time.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:16.490
At any rate, I have to help Majo Rika.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:27.630
No way!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.590
Hmm, If I remember correctly, Majo Rika dropped it...

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:35.720
She fell from here... like this...

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.770
Found it!

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:49.980
Pop-chan!

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:51.860
Watch out!

00:16:51.860 --> 00:16:54.150
Just stop it!

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:59.740
If you want it, come and get it!

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:02.120
Give Plush-chan back to me!

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:14.160
Pop!

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:18.100
Kimitaka!

00:17:18.890 --> 00:17:20.720
Give Plush-chan back to me!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:26.810
Give it back!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.560
Persistent kid.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:32.190
I'll throw it into the water if you come any closer!

00:17:32.730 --> 00:17:35.280
Stop! I can't swim!

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:43.750
Don't come any closer!

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.290
Go away!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:48.670
Oh no!

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:52.380
Pop!

00:17:53.090 --> 00:17:54.420
The branch is going to break!

00:17:57.090 --> 00:18:00.760
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:03.470
Branch, don't break!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:22.580
Thank God she's here. I'm saved for now.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:32.670
Kimitaka-kun, Pop-chan, what are you doing?

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:36.010
It's dangerous. Get down here this instant!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.430
Be very careful! Go slowly!

00:18:38.430 --> 00:18:39.680
Yes ma'am...

00:18:41.720 --> 00:18:43.010
Lala!

00:18:48.100 --> 00:18:49.310
Plush-chan!

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.060
Gotcha!

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:13.040
Plush-chan?

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:16.920
Plush-chan, where are you?

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.510
Plush-chan!

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:29.640
Plush-chan is gone. Plush-chan...

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:32.020
Plush-chan...

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.240
Plush-chan is gone...

00:19:45.200 --> 00:20:01.340
I'm sorry.

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:07.480
My goodness...

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:11.620
There, there...

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.110
Pop.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.830
Nurse's Office

00:20:32.880 --> 00:20:33.540
Huh?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:35.750
No one's here.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:43.550
Oh yeah! We have a test today.

00:20:46.010 --> 00:20:47.760
A big zip.

00:20:47.760 --> 00:20:50.020
Doremi-chan will get zero points.

00:20:50.020 --> 00:20:53.480
Zero points is nothing. But the scribbling...

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.810
Dodo is taking the test...

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:58.940
What a disaster!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:01.940
Alright, I'm done.

00:21:01.940 --> 00:21:05.400
So, does it look like Majo Rika?

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:07.490
W-Well...

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.330
It's kinda similar...

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:13.080
It's the thought that counts. Pop-chan will be very happy.

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:14.330
I think so too.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:17.880
Why didn't you all just say we're not alike!?

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.490
What? What do you mean by that?

00:21:20.490 --> 00:21:24.840
It's all Majo Rika's fault that my test was disastrous!

00:21:24.840 --> 00:21:28.300
It would turn out the same even if you were the one taking the test!

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.680
Besides, Pop's got more guts than you.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:36.310
She's more suitable to be a witch apprentice.

00:21:36.310 --> 00:21:38.980
Might as well ask her to be one.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:43.490
What are you talking about? I used my magic quite well today.

00:21:43.490 --> 00:21:46.660
I will ace the next witch exam for sure!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:49.080
Flukes won't happen twice.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:50.990
It wasn't a fluke!

00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:53.750
Nope, it was a fluke.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:58.290
I said it wasn't a fluke!

00:22:01.030 --> 00:22:03.210
Doremi-chan falls in love again.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:05.280
Can she confess to him this time?

00:22:05.280 --> 00:22:06.570
To Hasegawa-kun, right?

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:11.530
No way! I'm supposed to go fishing with Dad, but Hasegawa-kun is coming too.

00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:12.740
Then that's a big chance for ya!

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:15.010
Ya ain't gettin' only fish, but Hasegawa-kun too.

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:17.690
That's called getting two birds with one fish, right?

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:20.210
Nope! It's supposed to be with one arrow!

00:22:20.210 --> 00:22:23.380
I think you two need to study more.

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:24.420
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:24.420 --> 00:22:26.030
Fishing for Love.

00:22:26.030 --> 00:22:28.280
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
